esigns like a DFF within OpenLane.\\n[Jupyter current working directory: /workspace]\\n[Jupyter Python interpreter: /openhands/micromamba/envs/openhands/bin/python]', code='print(query_docs_db(\"openlane configuration for small module like dff\"))', observation='run_ipython'), **FileEditAction**\nThought: Let's create an OpenLane configuration file for our DFF:\nRange: [L1:L-1]\nPath: [/workspace/config.json]\nContent:\n```\n\n```\n, FileEditObservation(content='--- /workspace/config.json\\n+++ /workspace/config.json\\n@@ -1 +1,18 @@\\n-\\n+{\\n+    \"DESIGN_NAME\": \"dff\",\\n+    \"VERILOG_FILES\": [\"/workspace/dff.v\"],\\n+    \"CLOCK_PORT\": \"clk\",\\n+    \"CLOCK_PERIOD\": 10.0,\\n+    \"FP_CORE_UTIL\": 15,\\n+    \"PL_TARGET_DENSITY\": 0.20,\\n+    \"FP_PDN_AUTO_ADJUST\": false,\\n+    \"FP_PDN_VPITCH\": 25,\\n+    \"FP_PDN_HPITCH\": 25,\\n+    \"FP_PDN_VOFFSET\": 5,\\n+    \"FP_PDN_HOFFSET\": 5,\\n+    \"SYNTH_MAX_FANOUT\": 4,\\n+    \"PL_RESIZER_TIMING_OPTIMIZATIONS\": true,\\n+    \"PL_RESIZER_DESIGN_OPTIMIZATIONS\": true,\\n+    \"GLB_RESIZER_TIMING_OPTIMIZATIONS\": true,\\n+    \"DIODE_INSERTION_STRATEGY\": 3\\n+}', path='/workspace/config.json', prev_exist=False, old_content=None, new_content='{\\n    \"DESIGN_NAME\": \"dff\",\\n    \"VERILOG_FILES\": [\"/workspace/dff.v\"],\\n    \"CLOCK_PORT\": \"clk\",\\n    \"CLOCK_PERIOD\": 10.0,\\n    \"FP_CORE_UTIL\": 15,\\n    \"PL_TARGET_DENSITY\": 0.20,\\n    \"FP_PDN_AUTO_ADJUST\": false,\\n    \"FP_PDN_VPITCH\": 25,\\n    \"FP_PDN_HPITCH\": 25,\\n    \"FP_PDN_VOFFSET\": 5,\\n    \"FP_PDN_HOFFSET\": 5,\\n    \"SYNTH_MAX_FANOUT\": 4,\\n    \"PL_RESIZER_TIMING_OPTIMIZATIONS\": true,\\n    \"PL_RESIZER_DESIGN_OPTIMIZATIONS\": true,\\n    \"GLB_RESIZER_TIMING_OPTIMIZATIONS\": true,\\n    \"DIODE_INSERTION_STRATEGY\": 3\\n}', observation='edit', impl_source='oh_aci', formatted_output_and_error='File created successfully at: /workspace/config.json'), IPythonRunCellAction(code=\"print(run_openlane('/workspace/confi