suggested, setting an explicit `PL_TARGET_DENSITY` is considered a better fix.\\n\\nThese adjustments help in achieving better placement convergence by optimizing the logic density and managing the placement algorithm's parameters effectively.\\n[Jupyter current working directory: /workspace]\\n[Jupyter Python interpreter: /openhands/micromamba/envs/openhands/bin/python]\", code='print(query_docs_db(\"openlane RePlAce diverged at newStepLength error and how to fix it\"))', observation='run_ipython'), **FileEditAction**\nThought: Let's modify our configuration again:\nRange: [L1:L-1]\nPath: [/workspace/config.json]\nContent:\n```\n\n```\n, FileEditObservation(content='--- /workspace/config.json\\n+++ /workspace/config.json\\n@@ -7,3 +7,3 @@\\n-    \"DIE_AREA\": \"0 0 35 35\",\\n-    \"FP_CORE_UTIL\": 10,\\n-    \"PL_TARGET_DENSITY\": 0.15,\\n+    \"DIE_AREA\": \"0 0 50 50\",\\n+    \"FP_CORE_UTIL\": 30,\\n+    \"PL_TARGET_DENSITY\": 0.35,\\n@@ -22 +22,2 @@\\n-    \"FP_IO_MIN_DISTANCE\": 2\\n+    \"FP_IO_MIN_DISTANCE\": 2,\\n+    \"PL_MAX_PHI_COEFFICIENT\": 100', path='/workspace/config.json', prev_exist=True, old_content='{\\n    \"DESIGN_NAME\": \"dff\",\\n    \"VERILOG_FILES\": [\"/workspace/dff.v\"],\\n    \"CLOCK_PORT\": \"clk\",\\n    \"CLOCK_PERIOD\": 10.0,\\n    \"FP_SIZING\": \"absolute\",\\n    \"DIE_AREA\": \"0 0 35 35\",\\n    \"FP_CORE_UTIL\": 10,\\n    \"PL_TARGET_DENSITY\": 0.15,\\n    \"FP_PDN_AUTO_ADJUST\": false,\\n    \"FP_PDN_VPITCH\": 25,\\n    \"FP_PDN_HPITCH\": 25,\\n    \"FP_PDN_VOFFSET\": 5,\\n    \"FP_PDN_HOFFSET\": 5,\\n    \"SYNTH_MAX_FANOUT\": 4,\\n    \"PL_RESIZER_TIMING_OPTIMIZATIONS\": true,\\n    \"PL_RESIZER_DESIGN_OPTIMIZATIONS\": true,\\n    \"GLB_RESIZER_TIMING_OPTIMIZATIONS\": true,\\n    \"DIODE_INSERTION_STRATEGY\": 3,\\n    \"MAGIC_EXT_USE_GDS\": false,\\n    \"QUIT_ON_ILLEGAL_OVERLAPS\": false,\\n    \"FP_IO_MIN_DISTANCE\": 2\\n}', new_content='{\\n    \"DESIGN_NAME\": \"dff\",\\n    \"VERILOG_FILES\": [\"/workspace/dff.v\"],\